g coefficient of $P(x)$ is negative.\n\nTherefore, statement I is false, while statements II and III are true."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129678 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129142 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "5dce1c69-c79d-541a-b479-8fc127352c2a" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying the Graph of a Polynomial"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c673febf-2343-532e-b3f8-d17144d07bb4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186127550} {:answer/id #uuid "d61ae7a1-00bb-5f11-ad1d-b0434b01b6c4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "None of the given options is correct" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186127551} {:answer/id #uuid "e412493d-069b-51b7-a259-1b98f29e80ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "B" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186127552} {:answer/id #uuid "efd3f6e9-8c99-5bdf-b917-997aad0d4a98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186127553} {:answer/id #uuid "082c4fa3-468a-5f61-8c9b-166620b0d5a7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "D" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186127554}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c673febf-2343-532e-b3f8-d17144d07bb4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186127550} :answer-field/id #uuid "5176cfc6-698c-5192-a037-61627dd873dc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186127549}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "0a195ea9-9030-592b-a61d-ebfc1a12796b" :question/math-academy-id "q-38611" :question/problem "![](images/43/43e2c01d6e2ee22fe666bbaa46586b43467f8dd5